---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Container from "@/components/ui/Container.astro";
import CTA from "@/components/sections/CTA.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="Learn about Cllipify's mission to democratize video creation with AI-powered tools."
>
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="pt-32 pb-16 lg:pt-40 lg:pb-24">
    <Container size="narrow">
      <div class="text-center">
        <h1 class="animate-on-scroll text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-6">
          Making video creation
          <span class="text-gradient">accessible to everyone</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="animate-on-scroll text-lg text-muted-foreground max-w-2xl mx-auto" style="animation-delay: 0.1s;">
          We believe everyone should be able to bring their ideas to life through video,
          regardless of technical skill or budget.
        </p>
      </div>
    </Container>
  </section>

  <!-- Mission Section -->
  <section class="py-16 lg:py-24">
    <Container size="narrow">
      <div class="space-y-12 animate-on-scroll">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Our Mission</h2>
          <p class="text-muted-foreground text-lg leading-relaxed">
            Cllipify was founded with a simple mission: to democratize video creation.
            We saw how powerful video content could be for communication, marketing, and
            storytelling, but also how inaccessible traditional video production remained
            for most people and businesses.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">The Problem We Solve</h2>
          <p class="text-muted-foreground text-lg leading-relaxed">
            Creating professional videos traditionally requires expensive software,
            specialized skills, and hours of editing time. For small businesses, content
            creators, and teams without dedicated video production resources, this creates
            a significant barrier to entry.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Our Approach</h2>
          <p class="text-muted-foreground text-lg leading-relaxed">
            By combining cutting-edge AI with an intuitive interface, we've made it possible
            for anyone to create stunning videos in minutes. Simply describe what you want,
            and our AI handles the rest - from generating visuals to adding transitions
            and effects.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Looking Forward</h2>
          <p class="text-muted-foreground text-lg leading-relaxed">
            We're constantly improving our AI models and adding new features based on
            community feedback. Our goal is to make Cllipify the go-to platform for
            anyone who wants to create professional video content quickly and easily.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </Container>
  </section>

  <CTA />
</BaseLayout>
